    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Milites Fortunae, a strategy game where you control a team of warriors! Take turns with your opponent as your warriors perform attacks known as Abilities, to deplete enemy units health and claim victory! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs a gamer with a job and family I understand that your time is valuable. This is a game that doesn't waste your time. You won't spend hours fiddling about with menus, or waiting for cutscenes to play. Instead it focuses on getting you into battle with a combat system that is easy to learn but difficult to master. Battles are tense and often one mistake is the difference between success and failure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features include:<br />\r\n-Deep, Strategic Turn-Based Combat<br />\r\n-Multiple Classes of Warriors<br />\r\n-Numerous Abilities<br />\r\n-Upgradeable Stats<br />\r\n-Approximately 5 hours of gameplay",
